==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[small#Adjective|small]] [[enclosure]] [[house#Verb|housing]] a [[public telephone]].
#: {{synonyms|en|phone booth|phone box|telephone box|telephone kiosk}}
#* {{RQ:Buchan Three Hostages|chapter=The House in Gospel Oak|page=85|passage=Then it occurred to me that I might be doing a rash thing in going off to an unknown house in a seedy suburb. So I went into a public '''telephone-booth''', rang up the Club, and told the porter that if Colonel Arbuthnot called, I was at 4 Palmyra Square, N.W.—I made him write down the address—and would be back before ten o'clock.}}

